<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling gained against the dollar and pound on Monday, central bank officials said.</p>
<p>They told Reuters the shilling traded at a mean rate of 624.8286 against the dollar from 625.1355 at close on Friday. Against the pound, it traded at 1037.6232 from Friday's 1045.5423.</p>
<p>--Nairobi newsroom ++254 2 224-717</p>
